     "detail": "Acme Fit has no web or app code yet, so there is no framework of its own to match. For a new product the usual pick is Tailwind with HeroUI, on the web and on the phone. To mock up with it, run `serve.py add-framework heroui` once and ask me to switch the screens to it."
